Linux 1.1.74.  It is a rewritten version of the first patch in order to
be more flexible.  The new kernel will have a directory dev in the proc
directory, which contains registered devices.  These devices can be used
for updating /dev by copying them and setting their access permissions.
An example script is contained to demonstrate it.

